to my knowledge, are perfectly capable of casting Touch of Death.  The
wiki seems to indicate they cannot, which might be a change when Arch
Liches were added.  I have been killed by a Master Lich via ToD in
previous versions.

Even if it can't cast Touch of Death, it well CAN cast Destroy Armor,
which can be almost as bad.  I think the way to handle this is to
abandon the level for now, until you've had a chance to blessed
genocide Ls.


